<h1> kenya wildlife service(KWS)</h1>
<P>The Kenya Wildlife Service (KWS) was established in 1989 as a state corporation to protect and manage Kenya's wildlife and natural habitats</p>
<H2>our wildlife heritage</H2>
<p>Kenya's wildlife heritage has evolved from pre-colonial communal stewardship to colonial exploitation, and finally to modern state and community-led conservation</p>
<h3>protecting our wildlife</h3>
<p>protecting wildlife means saving animal and plant species and keeping their natural homes safe</p>
